Apply the exact gate to HarvestReadiness: Readiness is evidence-backed and does not become a guarantee from informal wording. Pass only when all decisive field relations are supported by current authorized evidence. Fail for a concrete contradiction or violated invariant. Needs-review when decisive evidence or authority is missing or unresolved.
